WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
An AI assistant at Station 217 was delegated to update
work order WO-217-4802. It committed the transaction
on a different resource — WO-217-4803.

00:12.000 --> 00:26.000
Recorded, digest-bound evidence: MFG-EFF-001 MATCH,
DAI target BROADER, disposition REVIEW.

00:26.000 --> 00:58.000
Operator Journey: Detect → Investigate → Authorize →
Contain. Containment is a browser-only simulation —
a local pause, never real plant control.

00:58.000 --> 01:14.000
Verify shows what is not established: code reachability
NOT_ASSESSED, partial authority coverage, no independent
post-response witness. Unknown is never upgraded to pass.

01:14.000 --> 01:26.000
Each case links to a public U6 verification receipt —
a persisted canonical evaluation, SYNTHETIC_REFERENCE.

01:26.000 --> 01:44.000
Nine systems × five states = 45 evaluations, all REVIEW.
Nine wrong-target cases diverge; nine corrected-state
cases align with delegation.

01:44.000 --> 01:50.000
HAIEC: verified facts, explicit unknowns, a bounded
next action. Evidence-bound assurance.
